            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Browse our collection and choose the model that best fits your event—be it the ultra-compact <a href=\"https://rorry.com/products/rorry-d2-5000mah-portable-charger-keychain-power-bank-white-logo-customization\" title=\"Custom RORRY D2-5000mAh Portable Charger\"><strong>D2 CharmGo Series</strong></a> or the high-capacity <a href=\"https://rorry.com/products/rorry-palmgo-d5-10000mah-portable-charger-custom-logo\" title=\"Custom RORRY PalmGo D5-10000mAh power banks\"><strong>PalmGo D5</strong></a>. Our team provides personalized recommendations based on your budget and target audience.</p>",
