          "settings": {
            "title": "<strong>Can I resell RORRY products?</strong>",
            "text": "<p>To protect our brand integrity and existing partners, we <strong>do not allow</strong> unauthorized resale on third-party marketplaces. Bulk purchases are intended for corporate gifting, employee appreciation, or authorized physical retail stores only.</p>",
